{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42767","headline":"晨鸡 · 刘兼","name":"晨鸡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱冠金距彩毛身，昧爽高声已报晨。\n作瑞莫惭先贡楚，擅塲须信独推秦。\n淮南也伴升仙犬，函谷曾容借晓人。\n此日卑栖随饮啄，宰君驱我亦相驯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}